<title>JAPAN: Godo Steel - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Godo Steel - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 43.77		vs	   43.19</p>
<p> Operating	prft 644 million    vs     loss 2.97</p>
<p> Current	  prft 204 million    vs     loss 3.59</p>
<p> Net		prft 320 million    vs     loss 3.65</p>
<p> EPS	     prft 2.00 yen	  vs    loss 22.76 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    160 million	  vs	 160 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Godo Steel Ltd is an electric furnace maker and belongs to the Nippon Steel Co Ltd group.</p>
